        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/thief-remastered-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Retro specialist Nightdive is at it again. After successfully tackling <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/system-shock\">System Shock</a> and its sequel (giving them the remake and remaster treatment respectively), Nightdive is once again returning to the world of legendary developer Looking Glass Studios and sprucing up another of its beloved early immersive sims. Yup, it's time to retreat to the shadows as we await the launch of <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/thief-the-dark-project\">Thief: The Dark Project</a> Remastered on PC and consoles.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/thief-the-dark-project-remastered-nightdive-studios\">Read more</a></p>",
